OL,3,ATories pledge #10bn British 'Iron Dome'
OL,4,Aair defence system
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Conservatives have pledged to
OL,7,Finvest #10bn in a British defence
OL,8,Fsystem, if they win the next general
OL,9,Felection, which is inspired by Israel's
OL,10,FIron Dome air defence system.
OL,12,FThe party said the "Britannia Shield"
OL,13,Fwould offer the UK an integrated
OL,14,Fnetwork of radar, command and control
OL,15,Fsystems, as well as interceptor
OL,16,Fmissiles.
OL,18,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch said
OL,19,Fit would help protect the country
OL,20,Fagainst a "new type of warfare" that
OL,21,Fcould see drones and missiles attacking
OL,22,Fcritical national infrastructure.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
