OL,3,ATories pledge #10bn British 'Iron Dome'
OL,4,Aair defence system
OL,5,
OL,6,FDefence Secretary Wes Streeting said
OL,7,Fthe Tories had an "abysmal record" of
OL,8,Fdefending Britain during their 14 years
OL,9,Fin power, adding: "They owe Britain an
OL,10,Fapology, not another lecture."
